{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE DOWNLOAD LINK FOR THE DEMO IS ABOVE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sixth Force</strong> is a two-player co-op puzzle adventure where the mysterious Sixth Force literally tethers you together. That glowing bond morphs into <strong>energy whips</strong>\u2014equal parts superpower and troublemaker:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing, slide on rails, and grapple</strong>\u2014bungee past hazards or ping-pong your partner into them (accidentally\u2026 right?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, resize, and manipulate objects with telekinesis</strong>\u2014for big-brain (or big-fail) moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight enemies</strong> with crack-of-the-whip staggers and clutch rescue yanks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase through walls</strong> and <strong>summon light bridges</strong> across chasms\u2014and sometimes between people.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short fail loops and tight co-op, built for friends-and-family mayhem\u2014<strong>local or via Steam Remote Play Together</strong>. Either way, this journey is meant to be shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea2\u00a0<strong>The Bond Core Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glowing bond between characters starts short and a bit frustrating \u2014 just like real-life tension. But as their bond deepens, it grows stronger and unlocks unique co-op super-powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Telekinesis &amp; World Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, solve puzzles, and reshape the world. As trust builds, you\u2019ll unlock the power to create, destroy, and transform your surroundings together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f The Sixth Force in Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At full strength, the bond lets you make the intangible real \u2014 light becomes platforms,  and yes\u2026 you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Dreamlike Simulations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal digital worlds built from the characters\u2019 talents, dreams, and memories \u2014 a journey through their inner lives, one level at a time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Fun for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned gamer or new to co-op games, Sixth Force offers challenges and playful problem-solving for all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef7\u00a0<strong>Fooling Around</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s always time for fun, trolling, and messing with each other! Who found the combo?  Who\u2019ll win the tug-of-war with the bond?\u00a0Who\u2019ll slide down the plastic slide first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75e987c.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Two controllers required\u00a0</strong>\u2013 <i>Sixth Force</i> is designed as a co-op-only experience. No single-player mode available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Shared-screen local &amp; online co-op</strong> \u2013 Whether you\u2019re playing side by side or via Steam Remote Play, the shared-screen setup keeps both players fully in sync and in the action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Demo-preview of the full game\u00a0</strong>\u00a0- Play through the <strong>first two levels</strong> and get a taste of the story, mechanics, and atmosphere of <i>Sixth Force</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and follow Sixth Force and be the first to try the full adventure upon release!</strong><br><br><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2830090?t=1761508177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/d98ec639b97fdd72fc50ba37d149ae6aa95e032c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761508177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/c5d62c5e215201ee885eb497d9fb1967f4566f5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761508177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/c5d62c5e215201ee885eb497d9fb1967f4566f5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761508177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3451190,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE DOWNLOAD LINK FOR THE DEMO IS ABOVE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sixth Force</strong> is a two-player co-op puzzle adventure where the mysterious Sixth Force literally tethers you together. That glowing bond morphs into <strong>energy whips</strong>\u2014equal parts superpower and troublemaker:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swing, slide on rails, and grapple</strong>\u2014bungee past hazards or ping-pong your partner into them (accidentally\u2026 right?).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, resize, and manipulate objects with telekinesis</strong>\u2014for big-brain (or big-fail) moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight enemies</strong> with crack-of-the-whip staggers and clutch rescue yanks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phase through walls</strong> and <strong>summon light bridges</strong> across chasms\u2014and sometimes between people.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short fail loops and tight co-op, built for friends-and-family mayhem\u2014<strong>local or via Steam Remote Play Together</strong>. Either way, this journey is meant to be shared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udea2\u00a0<strong>The Bond Core Mechanic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The glowing bond between characters starts short and a bit frustrating \u2014 just like real-life tension. But as their bond deepens, it grows stronger and unlocks unique co-op super-powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/b3439fd612c1ee77ace2d285d18d94b1.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde0 Telekinesis &amp; World Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move objects, solve puzzles, and reshape the world. As trust builds, you\u2019ll unlock the power to create, destroy, and transform your surroundings together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/2c065ffb9165e6eb770bea499df346fc.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f The Sixth Force in Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At full strength, the bond lets you make the intangible real \u2014 light becomes platforms,  and yes\u2026 you can fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/728cd41b78bb3e902b8e06cc054d68dc.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Dreamlike Simulations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore surreal digital worlds built from the characters\u2019 talents, dreams, and memories \u2014 a journey through their inner lives, one level at a time.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/83745ce746d0502521efd712d919d85f.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udd1d Fun for everyone</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a seasoned gamer or new to co-op games, Sixth Force offers challenges and playful problem-solving for all skill levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.poster.avif?t=1761508177\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.webm?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/bc25983223a03f7c0946388d8b36585e.mp4?t=1761508177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udef7\u00a0<strong>Fooling Around</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s always time for fun, trolling, and messing with each other! Who found the combo?  Who\u2019ll win the tug-of-war with the bond?\u00a0Who\u2019ll slide down the plastic slide first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830090/extras/080d6b07d1dae787d7310ba8e75